UID:dd6a2900605a744ba7fd35f9bf1a5a3f@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Classes are specifically tailored to address the needs of firs
 t responders\, focusing on stress injury prevention\, mindfulness promotio
 n\, and stress relief. Open to everyone and all skill levels. You don’t 
 need to be flexible! Bring a family member or friend if you want! Want to 
 participate at home? Sign up for the free zoom option here https://www.wel
 lnessliving.com/schedule/wellness_collective-4615bh?id_class_tab=1&k_class
 =951231&k_class_tab=76330
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
